  "label": "TMUA 2020 · Paper 1 · Question 13",
  "lead": "<img class=\"source-question\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Enlarge question\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"TMUA 2020 · Paper 1 · Question 13 — Find the coefficient of x²y⁴ in (1+x+y²)^7.\">",
  "options": [
    "A",
    "B",
    "C",
    "D",
    "E",
    "F"
  ],
  "correct": "F",
  "hints": [
    {
      "title": "Choose what each bracket gives",
      "body": "<p>Think of seven copies of the bracket. To make <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></math>, how many copies must give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math> and how many must give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>? The others give 1.</p>",
      "recap": "You choose one term from each bracket.",
      "pitfall": "Choosing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math> once contributes two powers of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></math>.",
      "pause": "Write down how many brackets must give each of the three terms.",
      "recall": [
        {
          "lessonId": "p1-b1-l11",
          "reminder": "You choose one term from each bracket."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Count the choices",
      "body": "<p>Choose which brackets give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math> first. Then choose which of the unused brackets give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>.</p>",
      "recap": "Multiply the two numbers of choices.",
      "pitfall": "Once a bracket has supplied <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>, you cannot also use it for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>.",
      "pause": "Write the two combinations and multiply them.",
      "recall": [
        {
          "lessonId": "p1-b2-l03",
          "reminder": "Multiply the two numbers of choices."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "solution": "<p>In the product of seven factors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>, the target <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></math> requires two x choices, two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></math> choices and three 1 choices. Choose the x factors in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00028;</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></math> ways, then the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></math> factors in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00028;</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></math> ways.</p><p>The coefficient is therefore <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>&#x000D7;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>210</mn></mrow></math>, equivalently <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#x00021;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x00021;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x00021;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x00021;</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>.</p><p><strong>Answer F: 210.</strong></p>",
